              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "दोपार मांय रेत बळै है। dopār mā̃y ret baḷai hai. At midday the sand is scorching."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): वो दीयो बळ्यो, vo dīyo baḷyo."
            }
