          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बळणो (baḷṇo) is inherited from a reconstructed dvalati, \"burns\"; CDIAL lists the Old Marwari verb balaï, \"burns\" (CDIAL 6654). बाळणो, to burn something, is its partner."
